        "text": "\u003d{stopSimulation} className\u003d\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-yellow-600 hover"
      }, {
        "text": ":bg-yellow-700 text-white py-1.5 px-2 rounded font-bold text"
      }, {
        "text": "-[13px] transition-colors\"\u003e\n                \u003cSquare size\u003d{14} fill\u003d\"currentColor\" /\u003e STOP"
      }, {
        "text": "\n              \u003c/button\u003e\n              \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{resetSimulation} className\u003d\"flex items-center justify-center gap"
      }, {
        "text": "-2 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white py-1"
      }, {
        "text": ".5 px-2 rounded font-bold text-[13px] transition-colors\"\u003e\n                \u003cRotateCc"
      }, {
        "text": "w size\u003d{14} /\u003e RESET\n              \u003c/button\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      "
      }, {
        "text": "\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  );\n}\n\nexport default App;\n```"
