      }, {
        "text": "\n\n**CRITICAL Final Setup Check:**\n1. Refresh the app.\n2. Click the red **RESET ALL** button in the customization"
      }, {
        "text": " lab so it grabs the new C++ code (which has the new `Wire.begin()` logic).\n3. Add the **1"
      }, {
        "text": "6x2 LCD** back in the Customization Lab.\n4. Hit Run. \n\nIf this doesn\u0027t"
      }, {
