      "text": "`\n\u003e Compiling code via Cloud Compiler...\n\u003e Flashing to Virtual Flash Memory...\n\u003e Sandbox Physics Engine RUNNING...\n`\n`\nSystem Booting...\nRobot Ready!\nDriving Forward...\n`\nand still OFFLINE",
